{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Become a Whale?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A &quot;whale&quot; refers to someone who spends an outrageous amount of money on online games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They may be scorned for wasting money, but in the game world, their overwhelming strength earns admiration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simulation game where you can experience life as one of these legendary whales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on part-time jobs, start a company, earn money, and sink it all into a virtual social game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the City!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/c81eafa26d8310dc90f789f050bbe3c7.poster.avif?t=1750335510\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/c81eafa26d8310dc90f789f050bbe3c7.webm?t=1750335510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/c81eafa26d8310dc90f789f050bbe3c7.mp4?t=1750335510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various events will occur around the city. Complete them to earn valuable rewards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work and Earn Money!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/a73bcab3bc1146a9c1c92ec5beced778.poster.avif?t=1750335510\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/a73bcab3bc1146a9c1c92ec5beced778.webm?t=1750335510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co